2026-06-05 02:49:24.409251 I | ceph-spec: ceph-block-pool-controller: CephCluster "rook-ceph" found but skipping reconcile since ceph hThe logs indicate that the Rook-Ceph operator is skipping reconciliation because the Ceph cluster is in HEALTH_ERR with timed-out status checks, indicating a broken or unreachable monitor quorum rather than a disk issue. The operator is failing to connect with Ceph Monitors (Mons), resulting in failed requests to manage pools or OSDs. To resolve this, verify the status of the rook-ceph-mon pods, ensure node network connectivity, and check for full disk space on the VMs. If necessary, wipe the /var/lib/rook directory and disk partitions (/dev/vdb, /dev/vdc) to perform a clean deployment.
